{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BoJjAWL2mH4ZkNoYtKeBn8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've read the full paper and the review context YAML. Now I need to dispatch a full review with 2 reviewers (R1: methods + experiments, R2: novelty + related work), followed by a complete roundtable (Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize).\n\nLet me launch R1 and R2 as parallel agents for Step 1 (independent reviews), then do the roundtable steps.\n\nLet me structure the review carefully. The paper proposes SICA (Symbolic Invariant Consensus Aggregation) which extracts FOL constraints from LLM reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to resolve answer selection. \n\nThe core insight is framing this as \"when does symbolic consensus help?\" rather than claiming universal improvement, with C0 serving as a diagnostic baseline. Now I'll spin up R1 and R2 in parallel to begin the independent review phase.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32103,"cache_read_input_tokens":22945,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32103},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78f4268f-add9-4f5f-97a8-4d696a1c2e4e","uuid":"708506b6-a0a8-4a6a-b0e8-5126eb5b4b0d"}
